THIRD-PARTY DATA

O*NET: data/onet_ability_weights.csv contains derived values (normalized importance and level
ratings and their product) computed from the O*NET 30.3 Database by the U.S. Department of Labor,
Employment and Training Administration (USDOL/ETA), used under the CC BY 4.0 license. O*NET is a
trademark of USDOL/ETA. No raw O*NET files are redistributed.

Anthropic Economic Index: data/aei_job_exposure.csv is the occupation-level observed-exposure file
from the Anthropic Economic Index (https://huggingface.co/datasets/Anthropic/EconomicIndex),
released by Anthropic under CC BY. Cite Handa et al. (2025), arXiv:2503.04761.
